{%- doc -%}
  Renders the unit price, including its measurement.

  Port of stock Horizon v4.1.1 (68760d9) snippets/unit-price.liquid
  (horizon-blocks Phase 10), renamed hz-unit-price — Dawn ships a
  snippets/unit-price.liquid (collision rename, same family as hz-swatch /
  hz-price / hz-product-media). 'accessibility.unit_price' | t hardcoded to
  Horizon's English ("Unit price") per the track precedent. Its .unit-price
  support rules live in snippets/hz-price.liquid's extracted stylesheet
  (hz-price is its only hz caller).

  @param {object} price - The unit price (money or string).
  @param {object} measurement - The unit_price_measurement object.

  @example
  {% render 'hz-unit-price', price: variant.unit_price, measurement: variant.unit_price_measurement %}
{%- enddoc -%}
<small class="unit-price">
  <span class="visually-hidden">Unit price</span>
  {{ price | unit_price_with_measurement: measurement }}
</small>
